  [38;5;246mA task's due date has passed, or is within a lead time you set. The most common reason people want reminders at all, [39m
  [38;5;246mand the one that most needs the catch-up sweep.[39m
[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m2.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m [38;5;153mStarred task changed[39m
  [38;5;246mYou explicitly flag tasks as ones you care about; any edit to them surfaces. This is the literal reading of your [39m
  [38;5;246mrequest, and gives 'care about' a concrete meaning in a single-user app.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Task went stale
  [38;5;246mAn open task with no activity for N days resurfaces so it doesn't rot silently at the bottom of the list.[39m
